{"Title":"An Act to increase housing production in the city of Lowell","BillNumber":"S2977","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S30","Name":"Senate Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S30","ResponseDate":"2024-11-04T10:33:45"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-09-19T13:53:04.36"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-09-19T13:54:21.5766667"},{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-09-19T13:54:21.5766667"},{"Id":"R_M2","Name":"Rady Mom","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_M2","ResponseDate":"2023-09-19T13:54:21.5766667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2977/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, November 4, 2024 -- The committee on Senate Ways and Means, to whom was referred the Senate Bill to increase housing production in the city of Lowell (Senate, No. 2470),- reports, recommending that the same ought to pass with an amendment substituting a new draft with the same title (Senate, No. 2977).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 2 of chapter 193 of the acts of 2000, as appearing in section 1 of chapter 97 of the acts of 2002, is hereby amended by striking out, each time it appears, the figure “45” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following figure:- 40.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 3 of said chapter 193, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out the figure “180” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- 187.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Said section 3 of said chapter 193, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by striking out the figure “81” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- 75.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}